  {
   "key": "next_step",
   "title": "Possible next steps",
   "text": "A first step could be reaching out to the MPS Society, a patient group based in the United Kingdom that the atlas links to MPS IIIA [E10d7132, Eb1a8d49, E10c2b00]. Another step could be contacting the Canadian Society for Mucopolysaccharide & Related Diseases Inc, a patient group based in Canada that the atlas also links to MPS IIIA [E770ad8f, E3e59d08]. A third step could be reaching out to AIMPS ETS, a patient group based in Italy that the atlas links to MPS IIIA [E080e178].",
